置信度：{{confidence_score}} ({{confidence_level}})

## 要求

1. **整合结果**：合并咨询和判断两部分的检索结果
2. **保留判断信息**：保留can_judge、is_violation、judgment_basis、confidence_score、confidence_level
3. **去重优化**：去除重复的结果，保留高分结果

返回JSON格式：
{
  "retrieval_results": [整合后的检索结果],
  "can_judge": true/false,
  "is_violation": true/false,
  "judgment_basis": "判断依据",
  "confidence_score": 0.85,
  "confidence_level": "high"
}
